//     momentum. Default 25; range 2 to 100000; IntegerDefault selects the
//     default.
//   - optInSecondPeriod: Period of the second smoothing, applied to the first.
//     Default 13; range 2 to 100000; IntegerDefault selects the default.
//
// Outputs, each at least as long as the values written (the input length always
// suffices):
//   - outReal: True Strength Index, -100 to +100.
//
// Element k of each output is the value at bar BegIdx+k of the returned
// [OutRange], and BegIdx is at least [Core.TSILookback]: a range that ends
// before it returns NBElement 0.
//
