// TSIStream is a live TSI over a growing series: [TSIStream.Update] takes each
// new closed bar and returns the value [Core.TSI] computes at that bar over the
// same series. Open one with [Core.TSIOpen] or [Core.TSIOpenAndFill].
//
// A stream belongs to one goroutine; [TSIStream.Clone] forks it.
